    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend a chapter of the laws of 2025 amending the civil service law\nrelating to requiring appointing authorities to provide appointment and\npromotion letters, as proposed in legislative bills numbers S. 5760 and A.\n6624, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
